0..67 Comment "/// This source compares two actions over one lambda written twice."
68..71 Comment "///"
72..113 Comment "/// Both actions unfold to the same path."
114..178 Comment "/// Their lambda bodies close over copies of the same variables."
179..182 Comment "///"
183..256 Comment "/// The checker compares the bodies by their free variables and captures."
257..324 Comment "/// It aligns the captures when their scopes use different layouts."
325..328 Comment "///"
329..370 Comment "/// - see: #3807 — written lambda calls"
371..414 Comment "/// - see: #3920 — lambda body comparison"
415..451 Comment "/// - see: #3976 — capture layouts"
